The clerk is likely making a pun. A "spirit" is another word for alcohol (liquor). If she leaves the crystal ball uncovered in her car, the sunlight shining through the glass sphere could act like a magnifying glass and ignite the interior—especially if she has a bottle of spirits in the car. 

Alternatively, it is a literal warning: sunlight passing through a crystal ball will focus into a intense beam of light that can easily start a fire. [end of text]


